// test_compiler_sized.fd — SH-5: Large program test (~5000 LOC)
//
// Exercises:
// - Deep nesting (100+ levels of match/if/for)
// - Large Vec operations (10K+ elements)
// - Large HashMap operations (1K+ entries)
// - Many functions (500+)
// - Many structs/enums (100+)
// - String operations on large strings (10K+ chars)
//
// This validates that the C codegen can handle compiler-sized programs
// without crashing, stack overflow, or gcc compile failure.

use core
use vec
use string
use collections

